{
  "key": 38536,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExamineTabletMale",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s good to see you!\r",
        "Without any further ado, I’d like you\n",
        "to examine this stone tablet.\r",
        "Something just like it was also\n",
        "discovered in the Kanto region.\r",
        "I want to ask for your help in\n",
        "solving the mystery behind this.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chen: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Je suis content de te voir!\r",
        "Je voudrais te montrer quelque chose. \n",
        "Regarde cette plaque en pierre.\r",
        "On en a découvert une toute \n",
        "pareille dans la région de Kanto.\r",
        "Je voudrais que tu me donnes \n",
        "un coup de main pour résoudre\f",
        "le mystère qui l’entoure.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExamineTabletFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s good to see you!\r",
        "Without any further ado, I’d like you\n",
        "to examine this stone tablet.\r",
        "Something just like it was also\n",
        "discovered in the Kanto region.\r",
        "I want to ask for your help in\n",
        "solving the mystery behind this.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chen: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Je suis content de te voir!\r",
        "Je voudrais te montrer quelque chose. \n",
        "Regarde cette plaque en pierre.\r",
        "On en a découvert une semblable \n",
        "dans la région de Kanto.\r",
        "Je voudrais que tu me donnes \n",
        "un coup de main pour résoudre\f",
        "le mystère qui l’entoure.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SayThanksToWhom",
      "en_US": [
        "I tried deciphering the engravings on\n",
        "the stone tablet.\r",
        "Apparently, it is for a Trainer to\n",
        "engrave his or her thoughts after\f",
        "growing as a person on an adventure.\r",
        "A Trainer fitting that description\n",
        "would be you.\r",
        "That’s why I’m asking you for your\n",
        "help.\r",
        "You’ve met many people and Pokémon;\n",
        "you’ve experienced many things that\f",
        "shaped you into the person you are.\r",
        "I want you to sincerely tell me who\n",
        "affected you the most.\r",
        "Tell me, to whom do you most want\n",
        "to say your thanks?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’ai essayé de déchiffrer \n",
        "les inscriptions qu’elle porte.\r",
        "Apparemment, elle permet à un Dresseur\n",
        "qui a mûri au travers de ses aventures\f",
        "d’y graver ses pensées.\r",
        "Tu corresponds parfaitement \n",
        "à cette description.\r",
        "Et c’est pour ça que \n",
        "je te demande ton aide.\r",
        "Tu as rencontré une multitude de \n",
        "gens et de Pokémon, et les épreuves\r",
        "que tu as traversées ont fait de toi \n",
        "ce que tu es aujourd’hui.\r",
        "Je voudrais que tu répondes \n",
        "sincèrement: qui voudrais-tu remercier?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExpressThanksToName",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm...\r",
        "You most want to express your\n",
        "thanks to {STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}?\r",
        "You’re absolutely certain of it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hm...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}?\r",
        "Est-ce vraiment ton choix?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_WhatWasThatPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: ?!\n",
        "What was that Pokémon?\r",
        "Is it somehow connected to\n",
        "the stone tablet?\r",
        "Hmm... Where did that Pokémon go?\n",
        "Its destination is intriguing...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chen: Mais...?!\n",
        "C’était quoi, ce Pokémon?\r",
        "Est-ce qu’il a quelque chose \n",
        "à voir avec la plaque?\r",
        "Hum... Où est-il allé?\n",
        "Tout cela est très bizarre...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_WhatWasThatPokemon2",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: ?!\n",
        "What was that Pokémon?\r",
        "Is it somehow connected to\n",
        "the stone tablet?\r",
        "Hmm... Where did that Pokémon go?\n",
        "Its destination is intriguing..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chen: Mais...?!\n",
        "C’était quoi, ce Pokémon?\r",
        "Est-ce qu’il a quelque chose \n",
        "à voir avec la plaque?\r",
        "Hum... Où est-il allé?\n",
        "Tout cela est très bizarre..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_NotSuggestingNoOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: What’s wrong? You’re not\n",
        "suggesting there’s no one?\r",
        "Tell me, to whom do you most want\n",
        "to say your thanks?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chen: Quel est le problème? Il doit \n",
        "forcément y avoir quelqu’un.\r",
        "Alors, qui voudrais-tu \n",
        "remercier par-dessus tout?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SurfaceIsUnmarked",
      "en_US": [
        "The surface is unmarked.\n",
        "It is polished like a mirror."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La surface est lisse et \n",
        "polie comme un miroir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_NameWhomIThank",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}, to whom I give\n",
        "my thanks."
      ],
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}, à qui je dois tout."
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_PokemonThatConveysGratitude",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: I...\n",
        "I don’t like to talk...\r",
        "I choose my words carefully, but they\n",
        "may still hurt someone accidentally...\r",
        "When I think of that, I clam up...\r",
        "That’s why I think this certain Pokémon\n",
        "is so wonderful.\r",
        "It’s a Pokémon that conveys the\n",
        "feelings of gratitude in a nice way...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Viviane: Je...\n",
        "Je ne suis pas très bavarde...\r",
        "Je veille à peser mes mots quand je\n",
        "parle, mais on risque toujours de\f",
        "blesser quelqu’un sans le vouloir...\r",
        "Quand j’y pense, je deviens muette...\n",
        "C’est pour ça que j’adore ce Pokémon.\r",
        "Il a un don pour communiquer\n",
        "la gratitude...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThatStoneTablet",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: That stone tablet...\n",
        "It has a strange feel to it..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Viviane: Cette plaque en pierre...\n",
        "Une curieuse sensation en émane..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThankYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Thank you...\r",
        "That must have been the Pokémon that\n",
        "conveys the feelings of gratitude...\r",
        "You made it so I could see it...\r",
        "So, I’ll have to convey thanks in my own\n",
        "words, too..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Viviane: Merci...\r",
        "Ce devait être le Pokémon de\n",
        "la gratitude...\r",
        "Tu m’as permis de le voir...\r",
        "Alors, je vais devoir te remercier\n",
        "avec mes propres mots..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThankYouToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: To you, too...\r",
        "Thank you..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Viviane: A toi aussi...\r",
        "Je tiens à dire merci..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}